{"title":"2024 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a positive 3-digit integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is equal to the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f536ef84810fcaa7b9f6413d92d1ad490b696ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(351) = 351 + 3 + 5 + 1 = 360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Note: The decimal representation of the 3-digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a81938ca5e71faa6894d9d52ac776c9efbe75d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/17667af808852e0182c34d84d2b05a6d58397ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\cdot 10^{2} + b \\cdot 10 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02d87822e750ee3434a1de58d897da679d2a5fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$836 = 8 \\cdot 10^{2} + 3 \\cdot 10 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"195\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/f/3af67ad4fd38c2e60e1331ec8e6d3a6117758ce4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(132)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the definition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361f77b719d280735f9c187f5dd37456e6e63c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(132) = 132 + 1 + 3 + 2 = 133 + 5 = \\boxed{138}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"345\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025831\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 513/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2040/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.635      1 2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    7.635      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35598:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025831 and revision id 278012. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}